<P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Lis&#8217; strong focus on Life Sciences is reflected in her appointment as Chair of AusBiotech&#8217;s NSW State Committee.</P>
