<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The Directors are pleased to present the 2026 remuneration report which sets out remuneration information for Immutep Limited&#8217;s <FONT
STYLE="white-space:nowrap">Non-Executive</FONT> Directors, Executive Directors, and other key management personnel. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Directors and key management
personnel of Immutep Limited during the financial year and up to the date of this report. </P> <P STYLE="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
