her services as a <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">non-executive</FONT> director, if shareholders approved at the 2024 AGM. Ms Anderson resigned on 4&nbsp;October 2024, and these performance rights were not issued. The share-based payment expense
recognised from date of appointment to 4&nbsp;October 2024 was reversed accordingly, and the Company paid the cash equivalent of the performance rights which related to the period up to the date of resignation. </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
<P STYLE="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
