</TABLE> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Under the cash bonus scheme approved by the Board of directors in February 2020, Mr Marc Voigt, Dr Frederic Triebel and Ms
Deanne Miller are each entitled to a cash bonus of A$300,000 and Mr Christian Mueller is entitled to a cash bonus of A$150,000 conditional on meeting predetermined KPIs that are designed to support our corporate strategy to develop product
candidates to sell, license or partner with large pharmaceutical companies at key value inflection points or on a change of control. As at 30&nbsp;June 2026, no obligation has arisen for recognition. </P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Key management personnel have no entitlement to termination payments in the event of removal for misconduct or gross negligence. </P>
 <p STYLE="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt ; font-size:8pt">&nbsp;</P><DIV STYLE="line-height:1.0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:2pt;border-bottom:1px solid #000000">&nbsp;</DIV>
