<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Information relating to the Company&#8217;s Executive Incentive Plan, including details of options issued, exercised and lapsed during the financial year and
options outstanding at the end of the reporting period, is set out in note 35. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><I>Unlisted options </I></P>
