<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Note 1(a) confirms that the financial statements also comply with International Financial Reporting Standards as issued by the International Accounting
Standards Board. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The directors have been given the declarations by the Chief Executive Officer and Chief Financial Officer required by section 295A of
the <I>Corporations Act 2001.</I> </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">This declaration is made in accordance with a resolution of the directors. </P>
